POST http://localhost:5000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Data Structures and Algorithms",
  "author": "Robert Gill",
  "category": "Computer Science",
  "copies": 5
}
### Get All Books
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books

### Get Single Book by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/books/6adcb59c389e25f6e434a84c

### Update Book by ID
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/books/6adcb59c389e25f6e434a84c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copies": 10
}

### Delete Book by ID
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/books/6adcb99e389e25f6e434a84d

### Get All Seats
GET http://localhost:5000/api/seats

### Book a Seat
POST http://localhost:5000/api/seats/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seatNumber": "A1",
  "bookedBy": "Dipa"
}